---
import Student from '../../layouts/Student.astro';
import { CHECKED_LABEL, SOURCES } from '../../lib/visa/au-rules.js';
---
<Student title="Visa self-check: Australia" lede="See how ready you look for an Australian student visa, and what to strengthen first. It takes about five minutes." active="visa" page="visa">
  <p class="vc-scope"><b>A self-check, not advice.</b> It does not predict what Home Affairs will decide and it is not tied to any agent or university. A case officer reads your whole application, including things this check cannot see.</p>

  <section class="st-card vc-result" data-result aria-labelledby="vc-res-h" tabindex="-1" hidden>
    <h2 id="vc-res-h">Your result</h2>
    <div class="vc-top">
      <div class="vc-band" data-band>
        <span class="vc-glyph" aria-hidden="true" data-glyph></span>
        <b data-band-name></b>
        <small>band</small>
      </div>
      <div class="vc-score">
        <p class="vc-points"><b data-score></b><span> out of 100 points</span></p>
        <div class="vc-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i data-score-bar style="width:0"></i></div>
        <p class="vc-say" data-say></p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="vc-held" data-held hidden></div>
    <h3 class="vc-h">What decides it</h3>
    <ul class="vc-factors" data-factors></ul>
    <h3 class="vc-h">What to strengthen first</h3>
    <ol class="vc-actions" data-actions></ol>
    <p class="vc-none" data-no-actions hidden>Nothing stands out. Keep your evidence together and check the official pages again just before you apply.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="st-card" data-empty aria-labelledby="vc-empty-h" hidden>
    <h2 id="vc-empty-h">Answer a few questions to see your result</h2>
    <p class="st-sub">We use the answers below plus your English test and visa history from your profile. Your result is worked out from the answers you save.</p>
  </section>

  <details class="st-sec" id="visa_au">
    <summary><span class="tick" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Your answers</span><span class="state"></span></summary>
    <div class="st-sec-body">
      <p class="st-sub">Answer for the course you are most likely to take. Do not enter passport numbers, visa numbers or bank account numbers.</p>
      <ul class="vc-profile" data-profile aria-label="What we use from your profile"></ul>
      <div data-form></div>
      <div class="st-actions">
        <button class="btn" type="button" data-save>Save and check</button>
        <p class="st-status" data-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </details>

  <section class="st-card vc-notes" aria-labelledby="vc-how-h">
    <h2 id="vc-how-h">How this works</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>The points and the Green, Amber and Red bands are our own way of organising the public rules. They are not Home Affairs scores.</li>
      <li>The money and English figures come from Australian law and were last compared with it in {CHECKED_LABEL}. Check the official pages before you rely on them.</li>
      <li>The Government is consulting on changes to the Genuine Student and money rules, so these can change.</li>
      <li>Nothing here uses artificial intelligence. The same answers always give the same result.</li>
      <li>Your answers are saved on your account so you can come back. You can download or delete everything from Settings.</li>
    </ul>
    <h3 class="vc-h">Official sources</h3>
    <ul class="vc-src">
      {SOURCES.map((s) => <li><a href={s.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow">{s.label}</a></li>)}
    </ul>
  </section>

  <script>import '../../scripts/student.js';</script>
</Student>
